      explanation: "The correct answer is Vitasta. Vitasta:- Vitasta or Jhelum River is one of the five rivers that flow through the Punjab region and is the westernmost of the five rivers. It originates from the Verinag spring in the Himalayas and flows through the Kashmir valley before entering Pakistan and joining the Chenab River.",
