      explanation: "The correct answer is Bombay. In 1849, a covert socio-religious organization called the Paramhans Mandali was founded in Bombay. It shares a tight relationship with Manav Dharma Sabha , which was established in Surat in 1844. Dadoba Pandurang, Durgaram Mehtaji, and several of his friends founded it.",
