      explanation: "The correct answer is Bahadur Shah Zafar. Bahadur Shah Zafar was the last Mughal emperor in the Indian subcontinent. After the death of Bahadur Shah Zafar, none of his descendants was recognized as kings. Bahadur Shah Zafar was the son of Akbar II.",
